# Foundation AddOn Cursor Rules

## Scope

Use this repo as a portable instruction/skill framework.

## Coding Rules

- Keep changes minimal and scoped.
- Prefer updating templates/scripts over one-off generated files.
- Mirror skill changes into `.claude/commands/` when required.
- Keep markdown concise and structured.
- Use ASCII unless existing file requires Unicode.

## Safety

- No secrets in code or outputs.
- No destructive git or filesystem operations without explicit instruction.

## Verification

- `python3 scripts/validate-foundation.py`
- `bash scripts/test-init-project.sh`
- `shellcheck scripts/*.sh`
